{"5023550":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Velocity - Midnight Run","steam_appid":5023550,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5029700],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the endless streets of Velocity. Race through a field of 100 cars into escalating traffic, cop chases and weather. Tune your car in real time with the built-in boost controller on every car, shifting power between acceleration, grip and speed as you drive. Hit blinding speeds while sliding through tight corners, side streets and alleyways. Take down cops, or lose them by slipping off the highway and into the offramps.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/86dd190c5327b2d8a387f0c934d8a862.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/86dd190c5327b2d8a387f0c934d8a862.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/86dd190c5327b2d8a387f0c934d8a862.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing. Finish at number 1... or burn it all down in a wreck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start stock. Thread a gap at speed. Hold a drift through the cloverleaf. Tuck into a slipstream. Earn that Style towards the next level. Level up and choose one of three upgrades. Take the same part again and it climbs a tier, up to tier 5. Rivals, cops, new roads and rain all escalate as you cut through the field. Can you make it to number 1 in one piece?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full Run-Stash-Strip-Build-Compete loop is in the game today.<\/i><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stash<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/05c472aad52e71f5272e68dfaa2c1e63.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/05c472aad52e71f5272e68dfaa2c1e63.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/05c472aad52e71f5272e68dfaa2c1e63.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe and stash your ride.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call out to your crew. Break off the chase and dive into a multi-level parking garage, where a technical drifting course laid out by your crew and rival gangs winds to the roof. Slide every corner and climb level after level. Reach the top and park in style, safe to fight and race another day.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strip<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/89473e674ec0db0755f0e3664f392bc2.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/89473e674ec0db0755f0e3664f392bc2.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/89473e674ec0db0755f0e3664f392bc2.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in this city goes to waste.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the cars you stash to the Chop Shop and strip them for your collection. Parts come rare in the city, but knowing how to use them is rarer.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/298c00213d99551e561ab32ed8dcea1a.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/298c00213d99551e561ab32ed8dcea1a.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/298c00213d99551e561ab32ed8dcea1a.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All for one more ride.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap your parts into your main ride and build the ultimate speed machine. Pick an ability for the night: Nitrous, EMP or Police Siren. Fit aftermarket parts, choose from eight tire compounds, and set up the boost controller so power sits where you need it. Then make it look the part: paint, finish, rims, underglow, window tint, decals, and swapped bumpers, hoods and side mirrors.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/9168fdd24617b17d04267064a3f69dd2.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/9168fdd24617b17d04267064a3f69dd2.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/9168fdd24617b17d04267064a3f69dd2.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put it all on the line.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stash the right car and a rival puts a hidden ride on the line in a pink-slip race. Win, and it joins the garage. Pink slips and parts wagers against other players are next, if enough players join. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game today<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Midnight Run for a roguelike run of building your car<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stash the car in a multi-level garage, strip it in the Chop Shop, and race for pink slips<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo to set up quick runs across five districts, with more to unlock as you climb the ranks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a Crew room and invite your friends to private multiplayer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue Online for matchmaking with other players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race a friend in local split-screen versus on one screen<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of cars with distinct handling across FWD, RWD and AWD<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fit 3 abilities, 14 aftermarket parts and 8 tire compounds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change paint, finish, rims, underglow, window tint, decals and body parts<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run the endless streets of Velocity. Race through a field of 100 cars into escalating traffic, cop chases and weather. Tune your car in real time with the built-in boost controller on every car, shifting power between acceleration, grip and speed as you drive. Hit blinding speeds while sliding through tight corners, side streets and alleyways. Take down cops, or lose them by slipping off the highway and into the offramps.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/86dd190c5327b2d8a387f0c934d8a862.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/86dd190c5327b2d8a387f0c934d8a862.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/86dd190c5327b2d8a387f0c934d8a862.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with nothing. Finish at number 1... or burn it all down in a wreck.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start stock. Thread a gap at speed. Hold a drift through the cloverleaf. Tuck into a slipstream. Earn that Style towards the next level. Level up and choose one of three upgrades. Take the same part again and it climbs a tier, up to tier 5. Rivals, cops, new roads and rain all escalate as you cut through the field. Can you make it to number 1 in one piece?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The full Run-Stash-Strip-Build-Compete loop is in the game today.<\/i><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stash<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/05c472aad52e71f5272e68dfaa2c1e63.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/05c472aad52e71f5272e68dfaa2c1e63.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/05c472aad52e71f5272e68dfaa2c1e63.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe and stash your ride.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call out to your crew. Break off the chase and dive into a multi-level parking garage, where a technical drifting course laid out by your crew and rival gangs winds to the roof. Slide every corner and climb level after level. Reach the top and park in style, safe to fight and race another day.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strip<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/89473e674ec0db0755f0e3664f392bc2.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/89473e674ec0db0755f0e3664f392bc2.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/89473e674ec0db0755f0e3664f392bc2.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing in this city goes to waste.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the cars you stash to the Chop Shop and strip them for your collection. Parts come rare in the city, but knowing how to use them is rarer.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/298c00213d99551e561ab32ed8dcea1a.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/298c00213d99551e561ab32ed8dcea1a.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/298c00213d99551e561ab32ed8dcea1a.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All for one more ride.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap your parts into your main ride and build the ultimate speed machine. Pick an ability for the night: Nitrous, EMP or Police Siren. Fit aftermarket parts, choose from eight tire compounds, and set up the boost controller so power sits where you need it. Then make it look the part: paint, finish, rims, underglow, window tint, decals, and swapped bumpers, hoods and side mirrors.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/9168fdd24617b17d04267064a3f69dd2.poster.avif?t=1793648192\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/9168fdd24617b17d04267064a3f69dd2.webm?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/extras\/9168fdd24617b17d04267064a3f69dd2.mp4?t=1793648192\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put it all on the line.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stash the right car and a rival puts a hidden ride on the line in a pink-slip race. Win, and it joins the garage. Pink slips and parts wagers against other players are next, if enough players join. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In the game today<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Midnight Run for a roguelike run of building your car<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stash the car in a multi-level garage, strip it in the Chop Shop, and race for pink slips<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Solo to set up quick runs across five districts, with more to unlock as you climb the ranks<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a Crew room and invite your friends to private multiplayer<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queue Online for matchmaking with other players<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race a friend in local split-screen versus on one screen<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a roster of cars with distinct handling across FWD, RWD and AWD<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fit 3 abilities, 14 aftermarket parts and 8 tire compounds<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change paint, finish, rims, underglow, window tint, decals and body parts<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Hold speed through an endless night city. Climb a 100-car field in Midnight Run, slip past traffic, shake the cops, and cash every near miss into style. Then take it to Solo, private Crew rooms, or Online matchmaking. An arcade night-driving racer built for one more run.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/d5717db55fa5cd63eab49aa6eff210f65d7dfd0f\/header.jpg?t=1793648192","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/86ab64c85f622c7b80f60989ab10e275aa173c69\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793648192","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5023550\/86ab64c85f622c7b80f60989ab10e275aa173c69\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793648192","website":"https:\/\/shoogarsoft.com\/apps\/velocity\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz (Intel Core i3 or equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible GPU with WebGL2 support (Intel UHD 620 or NVIDIA GT 730 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Runs in an embedded Chromium\/WebGL2 runtime. A GPU 